      ],
      "entries": [
        "Avathrael raises their plant-covered wings to block the incoming blow. They gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, it's deflected by Avathrael's wing, causing some of the dangerous plants growing on the wing to burst and release a cloud of toxic pollen. The triggering creature takes 2d10 poison damage (DC 29 basic Fortitude save). On a critical failure, the triggering creature is also sickened 1."
